 {"id":"QA-OFF-BY-ONE-5-R3","title":"[P3] RECURRENCE of QA-OFF-BY-ONE-5, new arm — chaos-disconnect grades OK on a Go toolchain refusal (GOTOOLCHAIN=local, bootstrap go 1.26.5 below go.mod floor 1.26.9): the app never started, so disconnect resilience is still unverified","status":"pending","priority":"P3","complexity":3,"created_at":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:57:50Z","capability_tags":["qa-harness","false-green","chaos"],"reasoning":"MEASURED clean-machine battery off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03 (agent cf73b3aa, hermes-fleet-03, tested SHA 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379, clone at that SHA, origin github.com/totalwindupflightsystems/off-by-one, clean).\nCell detail verbatim: chaos-disconnect OK 'chaos-disconnect tests: fails fast on disconnect (rc=1): go: go.mod requires go >= 1.26.9 (running go 1.26.5; GOTOOLCHAIN=local)'.\nPer-cell log /home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/harvest/qa-logs-2320801/disc.log contains ONLY that one line — no app start, no disconnect trace.\nROOT CAUSE reproduced on the agent: go.mod line 3 is 'go 1.26.9'; the battery bootstrap installs /home/kara/tools/go/bin/go with GOVERSION go1.26.5 (built Jul 1); the chaos probe runs with GOTOOLCHAIN=local GOPROXY=off by design (bunker-qa.sh:3043), so the build refuses before main() runs. With GOTOOLCHAIN=local 'go build ./...' exits 1 with the same message; with GOTOOLCHAIN=auto (the fresh-install cell's mode) the toolchain is downloaded and the tree builds — which is why fresh-install is OK and only the local-pinned chaos probe dies.\nConsequence: the rc=1 that the classifier reads as 'fails fast on disconnect' is a compile refusal. Same defect family as QA-OFF-BY-ONE-5 / -R2 (a non-disconnect failure scored as an OK disconnect verdict); new arm is the toolchain floor, not ENOSPC. Product disconnect behaviour remains UNVERIFIED.","acceptance_criteria":"Kill the false green at its cause, not in the evidence file. Either (a) the battery bootstrap installs a Go toolchain at or above the module's declared floor so the GOTOOLCHAIN=local probe can compile, or (b) the chaos-disconnect classifier refuses to score OK when the start log carries a build/toolchain refusal — 'go.mod requires go >=', 'command not found', 'no Go files in' must yield UNVERIFIED with that line quoted, never OK.\nProve with a fresh agent battery at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379: the chaos-disconnect detail either contains a real disconnect fast-fail trace from a started process, or reads UNVERIFIED naming the toolchain cause. Also keep GOTOOLCHAIN=local (the no-download intent is correct).\nREJECTS: editing the evidence row by hand; declaring the product healthy from a probe that never compiled; widening the go.mod floor to match the old bootstrap go.","detail":{"fingerprint":"b7d533a4ff2d6b4b230e0489c438c348b757219fd63af9d5cd99c5112d076688","evidence":[{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","tree_fp":"a8a792fb66ce4aba5fbc7311da658b10ccc391baf2c78fb1df6c141f15019288","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]},{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:15:22Z","tree_fp":"a8a792fb66ce4aba5fbc7311da658b10ccc391baf2c78fb1df6c141f15019288","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]}]},"deferred":true,"defer_reason":"ROUTED to qa-foreman/bunker-qa lane: chaos-disconnect arm graded OK on a Go toolchain refusal is a bunker-qa battery defect."}
