 {"id":"QA-OFF-BY-ONE-62","title":"[P2] HARNESS: act ci-pass dies inside 'Set up Go' for 3 of 5 jobs — concurrent setup-go toolcache extraction (ENOENT copyfile of src/archive/tar/testdata/writer.tar, ENOTEMPTY rmdir of /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.10/x64, 'version: not found') — zero product steps ran, so the cell reads FAIL while hosted CI on the same SHA is green","status":"pending","priority":"P2","complexity":3,"created_at":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:57:50Z","capability_tags":["qa-harness","ci-portability","act"],"reasoning":"MEASURED battery at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379 (agent cf73b3aa, act -q --pull, workflow .github/workflows/ci.yml).\nPer-cell log ci.log: jobs 'Corpus host-path hygiene' and 'golangci-lint' completed green (including golangci-lint 2.15.0 at 1m22s), while three jobs died in their setup step: 'Go 1.26' -> error 'Failed to download version 1.26: ENOENT: no such file or directory, copyfile /tmp/1243ea93-.../go/src/archive/tar/testdata/writer.tar -> /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.10/x64/src/archive/tar/testdata/writer.tar'; 'Binary seed probe' -> 'Command failed: version 0a/bin/sh: 1: version: not found'; 'Deploy gate self-test' -> 'Failed to download version 1.26: ENOTEMPTY: directory not empty, rmdir /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.10/x64'. Final line: Error: Job 'Go ${{ matrix.go-version }}' failed.\nAll three failures are confined to actions/setup-go writing the shared /opt/hostedtoolcache path while several act jobs extract the same Go 1.26.10 release concurrently — the product's own steps (build, test, seed probe, deploy gate) never executed in those jobs.\nIndependently verified: hosted CI for exactly 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379 is completed/success (gh run list: CI 6546b59e success 2026-11-04T18:08:57Z), so this is NOT code-red. The act invocation carries no toolcache isolation or job-concurrency pin (bunker-qa.sh:1038 and :1121 both call '~/bin/act -q --pull').\nEffect on QA: the ci-pass cell is unwritable as a product signal for any multi-job workflow — it fails before the product runs, and the failure detail names setup-go, not the product.","acceptance_criteria":"Make the act leg produce a product verdict for a multi-job workflow. Either pin act job concurrency (or give each job its own toolcache) so setup-go cannot race, or have the classifier name the cause and grade UNVERIFIED instead of FAIL when every failing job stopped inside its setup step (setup-go/toolcache extraction) and no product step ran.\nProve on a fresh agent at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379: ci-pass either returns a verdict derived from the product's own steps, or UNVERIFIED with 'setup-go toolcache' named in the detail; in both cases record the hosted-CI verdict (success at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379) in the same row so product CI is not read as red.\nREJECTS: raising the cell's pass threshold; marking the product red from a setup-step failure; disabling the ci-pass cell.","detail":{"fingerprint":"5531925546e0837da56fa06d35ef9bffa23b3e553388b9ae06298be51cc87115","evidence":[{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","tree_fp":"f38f1be03770f05879d9f5dcb85aef95126e5ee97689d8251243190ca0e29639","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]},{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:15:04Z","tree_fp":"f38f1be03770f05879d9f5dcb85aef95126e5ee97689d8251243190ca0e29639","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]}]},"deferred":true,"defer_reason":"ROUTED to qa-foreman/bunker-qa lane: the act toolcache concurrency defect lives in the bunker-qa battery (~/.hermes/scripts/bunker-qa.sh, maintained in coding-hermes-tools), not in this repo; coding workers cannot close a battery defect."}
 {"id":"QA-OFF-BY-ONE-63","title":"[P3] HARNESS: lint cell grades OK while golangci-lint is absent — only 'go vet ./...' runs, so the repo's CI-pinned golangci-lint gate is never exercised on the clean machine","status":"pending","priority":"P3","complexity":2,"created_at":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T22:57:50Z","capability_tags":["qa-harness","false-green","lint"],"reasoning":"MEASURED battery at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379 (agent cf73b3aa). Evidence row: lint OK 'make lint (rc=0)'.\nPer-cell log lint.log is two lines total: 'go vet ./...' and 'golangci-lint not installed, skipping'.\nThe repo's CI does run golangci-lint (v2.15.0, act job green in ci.log at the same SHA), so the clean machine reports a green for a gate it did not run: a lint regression that only golangci-lint catches would leave this cell green.\nThis is the coverage half of QA-OFF-BY-ONE-25 (which measured the golangci-lint debt off-battery); the harness half — grading OK from a partial lint — has no row.","acceptance_criteria":"The lint cell must either install and run the CI-pinned golangci-lint (recording its version string in the detail) or grade UNVERIFIED/partial naming the missing tool. Never OK from 'go vet' alone when the repo's lint target shells out to golangci-lint.\nProve by a fresh battery at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379 whose lint detail names golangci-lint and its version, or an UNVERIFIED detail that names the tool it could not install.\nREJECTS: treating 'go vet' as equivalent to the repo's lint gate; adding golangci-lint findings as product rows before the cell actually runs it.","detail":{"fingerprint":"a2079c31d6149f4fd36e1255db25f632c1771f51fe68beeca2e4542acd0e0bdb","evidence":[{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","tree_fp":"d89827bb877dcadc0e6e0338941d6dee969b7f34061bbf858bab42cbbb6808c8","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]},{"run_