nd-in/readme/off-by-one/ev-2026-11-16/release-asset-2026-11-16.txt witness=release:v0.3.0 verdict=none:open-finding commit=none:open memory=none:not-written","acceptance_criteria":"The README API Reference 'System' table (README.md lines 163-169) gains a row for GET /metrics/prom naming its content type (text/plain; version=0.0.4) and stating it never 404s, in contrast with /metrics which answers 404 when the observer is disabled.\nProve with `grep -n 'metrics/prom' README.md` (>=1 hit inside the System table, not in a stray paragraph) and by quoting the rendered table rows before/after.\nREJECTS: editing pkg/api/openapi.yaml or docs/observability-spec.md to satisfy this row — those are REVIEW-OB-024 and DOC-8; deleting the existing GET /metrics row (the JSON contract is unchanged and still documented).","detail":{"fingerprint":"d106b8539381e95f8c1a9b0da12c962be8602c0083d6874b9cd7c9bac3fc626f","evidence":[{"run_id":"off-by-one-readme-2026-11-16-18-00-12","ts":"2026-11-16T18:39:08Z","tree_fp":"377a845e6f96609090ab1424e6a21ce107f7c24f0e00149ad9feefd8425c5564","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/stand-in/readme/off-by-one/ev-2026-11-16/transcript-2026-11-16.txt","/home/kara/.hermes/stand-in/readme/off-by-one/ev-2026-11-16/release-asset-2026-11-16.txt","/home/kara/.hermes/stand-in/readme/off-by-one/ev-2026-11-16/live2-2026-11-16.txt"]}]},"commit_hash":null,"guard_result":null,"ci_result":null,"foreman_note":null,"completed_at":null,"type":null}
